{
  "name": "ops-effects",
  "_note": "OPS support-effect visuals on Free Flight. The Weather module owns the sky, so the plain atmosphere op is not enough: ForceWeather pins Clear or low cloud hides the effects. Camera poses are global metres; the target is the map point (-10000, 0). Rod: wide camera for the descent line, a closer one for the strike. EMP: the shell is a faint additive ring, so it is also shot at night. Read the captures, the run only checks that nothing errored.",
